# Fixture: ATTR_manip_device (X-Plane 12.1.0 touch-screen manipulator).
# XPlane2Blender has no field for it, so the line has to ride an object-level
# custom attribute to survive the round trip.  The tooltip has spaces on
# purpose - that is the part a naive split would lose.
TEXTURE	mini.png
POINT_COUNTS	4 0 0 2

VT	0	0	0	0	1	0	0	0
VT	1	0	0	0	1	0	1	0
VT	1	0	1	0	1	0	1	1
VT	0	0	1	0	1	0	0	1
IDX	0 1 2 0 2 3
ATTR_manip_device	button	Garmin_GTN750	Touch the screen
TRIS	0	6
